Meta Analytics setup

Add these values to the backend .env file:

META_APP_ID=995778152835724
META_APP_SECRET=your_meta_app_secret
META_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:5173/meta/callback

Optional:

META_GRAPH_VERSION=v20.0

The admin panel callback route is /meta/callback. Configure the same URL in the
Meta app Valid OAuth Redirect URIs. The backend exposes the admin-only Meta API
under /api/meta and stores selected Page and Instagram Business analytics in
MongoDB so charts can use stored daily history if Graph API requests are
temporarily limited.
